## 1. Scope

This reference covers cold shrink terminations and joints applied to 18/20 kV class cable in heavy industrial and mining distribution. It is written around service conditions rather than voltage alone, because at this class the accessory is often chosen by what the site throws at it.

## 2. Construction

- Pre-expanded elastomeric sleeve with integrated stress control and a conductive deflector at the screen.
- Sealing system designed for a dusty and wet installation environment.
- Mechanically robust outer wall for cable that is re-trained during maintenance.
- Indoor and outdoor configurations from the same insulating body family.

